ze="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Percentage of Participants</text><text text-anchor="middle" transform="translate(222.45999908447266 48)" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text">Who Mentioned Factors</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" x="92.23648071289062" y="342.84000000000003" height="103" width="210.52703857421875" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="99.23648071289062" y="354.84000000000003" height="12" width="12" fill="#666666" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text transform="translate(121.23648071289062 366.84000000000003)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> convenience</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="99.23648071289062" y="386.84000000000003" height="12" width="12" fill="#CCCCCC" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text transform="translate(121.23648071289062 398.84000000000003)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> costs</text><rect xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="99.23648071289062" y="418.84000000000003" height="12" width="12" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-linejoin="mitre" stroke-width="0.9"/><text transform="translate(121.23648071289062 430.84000000000003)" text-anchor="top" fill="#000000" font-size="19.84" font-family="Crimson Text"> established behaviors</text></g></svg></figure><div class="sr-only" role="region" aria-label="Long description for bar graph titled Percentage of Participants Who Mentioned Factors"><ul>
<li>The Percent data for the 3 bars are as follows:<br/>
